			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "Hover over an image to see its file name, format, loaded original dimensions, title, and tooltip text, even if it has no title. Local workspace images also show file size when available. File size is omitted for remote and encrypted notebook images."
